{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act14side_level_act14side_02_beg",
  "groupId": "act14side",
  "stageId": "act14side_02",
  "title": "息事寧人",
  "storyCode": "BI-2",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act14side/level_act14side_02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "ea42e66a6864578ee307936f54b969935c82ce7e2d86f2649a0cf9aad8f4e25b",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居",
      "text": "洛拉，一回家就幫忙幹活，真孝順啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極光",
      "text": "哪裡，是我應該做的，我也想到處走走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居",
      "text": "哎，出去學習過的就是不一樣，比我弟弟懂事多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居",
      "text": "多好的一個姑娘，真可惜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居",
      "text": "搬家之後，不知道還找不找得到你這麼好的姑娘了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極光",
      "text": "欸，莎莎姐，你不是在這裡住得好好的嗎，怎麼要搬家啦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居",
      "text": "還不是我爸。昨天不是三族議會上宣佈要讓聖女來管三大家嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居",
      "text": "我爸這不就來勁了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極光",
      "text": "啊......佐爾叔一直都反對恩希歐迪斯老爺的開放政策呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居",
      "text": "可不是嘛，當年我們一家是為了我弟和我的工作從北邊搬過來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居",
      "text": "本來呢，這些年磨著磨著，我爸也差不多習慣了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居",
      "text": "結果昨天還政這事一宣佈，他可高興了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居",
      "text": "昨晚吃飯的時候就一直在罵恩希歐迪斯老爺這些年做的事，我都聽煩了，還跟他吵了一架。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居",
      "text": "但也拗不過老頭子，說不定我們家就要搬回佩爾羅契家的領地去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極光",
      "text": "那你弟弟的工作呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居",
      "text": "誰知道呢，這次還政完，不知道圖里卡姆能不能還像以前那樣做生意呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居",
      "text": "我聽佩爾羅契那邊的說法啊，本來上次三族議會上也是聖女大人要恩希歐迪斯老爺交出谷地和礦區呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居",
      "text": "要是聖女大人來管謝拉格，恩希歐迪斯老爺估計討不了好吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極光",
      "text": "......也是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居",
      "text": "不過，這也是好事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居",
      "text": "你這幾年在外面可能不知道，一開始三大家族之間還挺配合的，但是最近啊，他們互相是越來越不對付。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居",
      "text": "上次議會之後很多人都覺得怕是要打起來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極光",
      "text": "......是呢，沒想到這次恩希歐迪斯老爺居然讓步了，而且是讓聖女大人來掌權。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居",
      "text": "對啊，不過要我說，早該這麼辦了，雖然我不討厭恩希歐迪斯老爺的開放政策，畢竟我們家也跟著賺了不少錢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居",
      "text": "但是，有的時候也確實覺得和老人們說的一樣，謝拉格變得不再像謝拉格了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居",
      "text": "現在恩希歐迪斯老爺決定讓步，事情別鬧太大，大家都是贊成的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居",
      "text": "大概也就你哥那種老頑固反對了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極光",
      "text": "我哥......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極光",
      "text": "我回來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極光的姐姐",
      "text": "唉，傻孩子，說了讓你回來就好好休息，非要幹活。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極光的姐姐",
      "text": "（輕聲）你這個什麼石什麼病的，你不心疼自己的身體狀況，我們還心疼呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極光",
      "text": "沒事，姐，這點活還不礙事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極光",
      "text": "咦，哥哥呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極光的姐姐",
      "text": "他說要去一趟工廠，剛才急匆匆地出門了，還說今天不會回來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極光",
      "text": "工廠？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極光",
      "text": "是隊長？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極光",
      "text": "隊長，有什麼事嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sharp",
      "text": "假期結束了，極光。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sharp",
      "text": "博士昨天在車站被佩爾羅契家的人接走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極光",
      "text": "哎？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sharp",
      "text": "博士是自願和他們走的，你應該明白我的意思，他多半有什麼計畫了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sharp",
      "text": "我大致看了一下地圖，從車站到佩爾羅契家要一段時間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sharp",
      "text": "現在，博士現在應該已經到佩爾羅契家了，我們也該行動了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sharp",
      "text": "我現在藉口去你家看看狀況，然後出來和你會合。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極光",
      "text": "好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極光",
      "text": "......先去和隊長會合吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶拉",
      "text": "原來如此，你就是那個羅德島的人啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "原來你不認識我。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你並不是特意找上我的。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "耶拉",
          "text": "是啊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "耶拉",
          "text": "你很獨特，但我也不知道你為什麼很獨特。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你在市場說的，是什麼意思？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "耶拉",
          "text": "嗯？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "耶拉",
          "text": "一點忠告而已。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "耶拉",
          "text": "你看，結果不是得被一群陌生人盯著，連出門逛逛都不自在嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你知道些什麼？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "耶拉",
          "text": "在回答你這個問題之前，先告訴我，你來謝拉格是為了什麼？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "出於和喀蘭貿易的商業合作。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "耶拉",
              "text": "也就是說，你是恩希歐迪斯的朋友？",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "幫崖心修復兄妹關係。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "旅遊。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "視情況而定。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "耶拉",
              "text": "我很好奇——像你這樣的外來者，是如何看待謝拉格這個地方的。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這裡很安寧。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "耶拉",
              "text": "安寧......是啊，這裡已經安寧了一千多年了。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "耶拉",
              "text": "安寧也意味著停滯。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "耶拉",
              "text": "謝拉格的人們太過習慣於這種狀態，以至於他們不在乎外面在發生什麼，也不感興趣。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "耶拉",
              "text": "這應該是一件好事，但最近，我又覺得......唉......",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "信仰很虔誠。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "耶拉",
              "text": "畢竟對耶拉岡德的信仰是將這片土地上的人們凝聚在一起的根本。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "耶拉",
              "text": "但是，有的時候，我也會覺得，人們有些太過依賴信仰。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "耶拉",
              "text": "你能明白嗎？你將你的煩惱向神傾訴，期待著神來幫你解決，然後就會變成——",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "耶拉",
              "text": "明明該用自己的意志去改變境況，卻只把神意當作停滯的藉口。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "耶拉",
              "text": "明明是用自己的雙手去耕耘得來的收穫，卻要在事後感激神明的慷慨。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "耶拉",
              "text": "明明真正做出了選擇，付出了努力的，應該是每個人自己......",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "落後。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "耶拉",
              "text": "真直接。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "耶拉",
              "text": "不過，像你這樣來自外面......按新說法，“外國”的人，大多都抱著這樣的看法。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "耶拉",
              "text": "外面的人們早已發展出了許多能夠讓人偷懶，或者說，省力的技術。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "耶拉",
              "text": "他們對便利的生活習以為常，而大多謝拉格人還不曾接觸過這些。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "耶拉",
              "text": "或許生活在謝拉格的人們確實能在這不夠便利的生活中錘煉出勤勞和勇敢，能從遠離享樂的環境裡學習到信仰和美德。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "耶拉",
              "text": "但我也不覺得這是應當永恆持續的事情。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "耶拉",
              "text": "謝拉格人開拓了這片雪山之間的樂土，但他們是否能夠只靠傳統來維持家園的堅實穩固？",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "耶拉",
          "text": "在你看來，謝拉格應該做出改變嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "需要。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "耶拉",
              "text": "哎，你也這麼想嗎。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "耶拉",
              "text": "其實明眼人都看得出來，恩希歐迪斯帶來的變革是無法停止的。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "耶拉",
              "text": "誰又能輕易拒絕讓自己的生活變得更輕鬆、更方便一些呢。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "不能一概而論。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "耶拉",
              "text": "我還以為你會說，這一切落後的事物都應該被改變。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "耶拉",
              "text": "我已經聽許多人說過這樣的話了。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "耶拉",
              "text": "而這些人，大多反而是土生土長的謝拉格人。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "我還不夠瞭解這裡。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "耶拉",
              "text": "真謹慎。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "耶拉",
              "text": "不過，我並不討厭謹慎的人。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "耶拉",
              "text": "只可惜，你可能已經沒有多少時間去瞭解這個國家現在的樣貌了。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "所以，你知道些什麼？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "耶拉",
          "text": "我......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "耶拉",
          "text": "我有一個朋友。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "耶拉",
          "text": "我的這個朋友，一直在思考，怎麼樣才能讓謝拉格變得更好。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "耶拉",
          "text": "但是，她想了很久，也想不出一個結果。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "耶拉",
          "text": "她逐漸發現，每個人想的都和她不一樣，而這些人的想法，無論哪一個，都令她感到不安。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "耶拉",
          "text": "她想要做些什麼，但是每當她想要做些什麼時，總有人勸阻她。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "耶拉",
          "text": "而且，她發現，她已經逐漸無法阻止那些人想要做的事了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "耶拉",
          "text": "就在這時，你來了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你認為這是一種預兆？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "耶拉",
          "text": "預兆？或許用病急亂投醫來解釋更合適。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "耶拉",
          "text": "一個接受恩希歐迪斯的邀請，來自異國他鄉的人，你的光譜和氣息讓我感到異樣的陌生與新奇——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "耶拉",
          "text": "告訴我，外鄉人，你的到來，意味著什麼？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "說起來，你可以先幫我一個忙。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亞",
          "text": "明明上次收到姐姐的信後也沒過多久，姐姐真是，好像很久沒有寫信了一樣，每次都這麼嘮叨。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亞",
          "text": "謝謝你，雅兒姐，每次都幫我把姐姐的信送過來。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雅兒",
          "text": "沒事，聖女大人不能隨意下山，我替她在外面走一走，給她帶去外面的消息，這也是她的心願。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亞",
          "text": "不過抱歉，我暫時沒有辦法給姐姐回信，我現在要準備別的事情。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雅兒",
          "text": "看你旁邊的包......你打算出門？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亞",
          "text": "是的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雅兒",
          "text": "你要去哪兒？去攀登少女峰嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亞",
          "text": "哎呀，你不說我都忘了，我至今還沒有征服少女峰呢！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亞",
          "text": "不過我這次要去的，是谷地。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雅兒",
          "text": "谷地？那裡不是正要移交給蔓珠院嗎，而且那裡好多工廠，你要去幹什麼？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亞",
          "text": "因為博士會去那裡，我要去見見博士。啊，雅兒姐，你還不知道博士是誰吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雅兒",
          "text": "啊，我聽說了，是那個被佩爾羅契家帶走的客人嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亞",
          "text": "嗯。博士畢竟是我的客人，不看到博士平安我心裡過意不去。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雅兒",
          "text": "真是個好孩子。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雅兒",
          "text": "不過你當心些，我聽說那邊最近不太平。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亞",
          "text": "嗯。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "角峰",
          "text": "二小姐，可以出發了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "角峰",
          "text": "不必擔心，這次出行，所有的責任由我承擔。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亞",
          "text": "角峰叔，給你添麻煩了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "角峰",
          "text": "二小姐難得認真請我幫忙，我怎麼會有不幫的道理。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亞",
          "text": "雅兒姐，我可能要出去比較久，請回去告訴姐姐，我之後再給她回信吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雅兒",
          "text": "沒事沒事，我可以等的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "text": "極光，我需要資訊來做判斷，尤其是來自你這個本地人的觀點，說說你對博士處境的看法。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "諾希斯作為礦區和谷地的前負責人，所處的位置應當十分敏感。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "眼下恩希歐迪斯老爺將博士放在了這個人的位置上，勢必會引起阿克托斯的關注。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "text": "詳細說說礦區和谷地的敏感原因。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "嗯......要是手邊有地圖的話會方便一些。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "謝拉格的地形不算很複雜，也沒有很細緻的劃分。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "一般，我們本地人一般都是直接叫礦區、谷地、林地、湖區、山區、溪地、平原的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "溪地和平原，以及大半的湖區是北邊的佩爾羅契家的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "西邊的布朗陶家領地以林地為主，以及小部分湖區。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "希瓦艾什家則主要是山區、谷地和礦區，湖區的部分幾乎可以忽略不計。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "而谷地和礦區......其實已經能夠代表將近一半的希瓦艾什家的領地。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "其中，礦區一直以來都是希瓦艾什家非常重要的領地，因為整個謝拉格用的礦石幾乎都是這裡產出的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "而谷地則是近年發展起來的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "原本，谷地是一塊非常貧瘠的土地，連村莊也沒有幾個，一直被認為是一塊沒有用的土地。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "但是，恩希歐迪斯老爺建立喀蘭貿易後，就將這片區域選作了工廠用地。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "喀蘭貿易的大部分製造工廠都建造在那裡，而且這一部分很靠近喀蘭聖山。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "此外，出發前我和一些謝拉格商人交換過資訊——不過出來做生意的人也都和喀蘭貿易有關。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "一個月前，在聖女大人的支持下，布朗陶家和佩爾羅契家要求並組織了一支調查工廠安全隱患問題的隊伍。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "但是這支隊伍卻遭到了拒不配合的諾希斯暗中指使的襲擊。我不知道消息是怎麼傳出來的，但所有人都相信此事與諾希斯有關。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "這導致了佩爾羅契家的家主阿克托斯在蔓珠院的授意下派兵進駐了谷地，而諾希斯也是因此次過激行動造成的後果才被革職。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "text": "會議上，博士提到過，恩希歐迪斯邀請他的理由。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "text": "雖然確實有協助喀蘭貿易進行礦石病相關設施的建設，但完全沒提過要讓博士替他管理任何事務。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "text": "也就是說，博士已經主動踏到陰謀的天秤之上了，很像是他會做的事情。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "這種可能性很高，但是，喀蘭貿易與羅德島的關係並不差，博士應當也是因為有這層關係才會接受邀請。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "我暫時想不到恩希歐迪斯老爺要陷害博士的理由......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "現在怎麼辦？聯絡凱爾希醫生？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "text": "本艦正在前往維多利亞，除非使用本地的大型通訊基地台，否則只靠我們攜帶的設備是沒辦法聯絡本艦的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "text": "（長歎一口氣）",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "隊長......？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "text": "我觀察了一段時間，博士目前的駐留地防備力量並不強。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "text": "佩爾羅契家的宅邸大概有衛兵兩百人，訓練和武器都不及外界正規軍，靠突然襲擊可以突破。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "text": "周圍的地形我也做過確認，另一個方案是滲透進入，不過這需要在多處提前做好爆破準備。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "text": "在進入和撤離時都需要製造爆炸來吸引注意力，有幾處牆面結構可以......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "等一下！隊長！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "text": "嗯？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "我覺得......事情還不會發展到那一步才對。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "text": "無論發生什麼事，都要保證博士的安全，這是我的第一要務。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "......這個我同意，但是......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "臨近大典，我們在佩爾羅契家族的領地動武，那羅德島恐怕會成為喀蘭聖山之敵。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "羅德島上的那些謝拉格幹員怎麼辦？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "text": "我需要隨時考慮最壞的可能性，以及最不體面的解決方法。眼下的事態不樂觀，如果我一定要做出選擇，你知道我只會選擇博士。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "text": "我們都希望事情不要發展到這一步，但你也知道，這不取決於我們，我要對博士和羅德島負責。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "我總覺得......恩希歐迪斯老爺可能有自己的想法。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "既然選擇了將計就計，想必博士早就察覺到了端倪，而且已經準備好應對手段了吧......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "text": "我從來都不會質疑博士的能力，我相信他。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "text": "但是我需要提前做好準備，博士讓我待命，那他的計畫裡就有我們的位置。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "我們得先和博士聯絡一下。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "text": "極光。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "嗯？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "text": "你很尊敬恩希歐迪斯。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "......是的。沒有恩希歐迪斯老爺，我是不可能走出謝拉格，接觸外面的一切的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "text": "我可以理解。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "text": "但我要你暫時忘了這件事，現在開始，你要將他視為假想敵，能不能做到？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "text": "如果覺得做不到，你現在可以回去，我不會責怪你。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "......但我同時也是羅德島的一員。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "text": "記住你現在說的話。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "是。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "text": "但是......我們也要提防崖心他們嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "text": "我相信崖心，但我不信任恩希亞·希瓦艾什。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "text": "接下來就是想想要怎麼去見博士。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雅兒",
          "text": "你們就是博士的部下吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "text": "......（斬擊）",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "一瞬間，堅鋼的長刀劃過了空氣，停在了少女頸部的毫釐之外。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雅兒",
          "text": "哇，這個刀法，很少見哦。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "text": "......什麼人？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雅兒",
          "text": "那個，沒有必要對剛見面的普通少女這麼兇惡吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "text": "能定位到這裡，還能在這種局面下開玩笑的，算普通少女嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雅兒",
          "text": "先把刀放下啦！是羅德島的博士讓我來找你們的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雅兒",
          "text": "博士有話讓我帶給你們。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
